<!doctype html>
<!-- Managed by the fractal SRC component; re-running it overwrites this file. -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Fractal on this workspace</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff; --fg: #1f2328; --muted: #59636e;
    --line: #d1d9e0; --head: #f6f8fa; --link: #0969da; --code: #eff2f5;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117; --fg: #e6edf3; --muted: #9198a1;
      --line: #3d444d; --head: #151b23; --link: #4493f8; --code: #262c36;
    }
  }
  body {
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    margin: 0 auto; max-width: 960px; padding: 24px 16px 48px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 32px 0 8px; }
  p { margin: 8px 0; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  a { color: var(--link); }
  code, pre { background: var(--code); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
  code { padding: 1px 4px; }
  pre { padding: 12px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .table { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px 10px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: var(--head); }
  td:nth-child(2), td:nth-child(3) { white-space: nowrap; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Fractal on this workspace</h1>
<p class="muted">{{ fractal_workspace_fqdn }}</p>

<h2>In the browser</h2>
<p>Everything is served over HTTPS from this one address. Use these links;
the ports in the next table are not reachable from outside the workspace.</p>
<div class="table">
<table>
  <tr><th>Application</th><th>URL</th><th>Internal port</th><th>What it is</th></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-web</td><td><a href="/">/</a></td><td>{{ fractal_web_port }}</td>
      <td>The Fractal web client: projects, datasets, workflows, jobs.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-data / vizarr</td><td><a href="/data/vizarr">/data</a></td><td>{{ fractal_data_port }}</td>
      <td>Serves the OME-Zarr data and the vizarr viewer. Uses your fractal-web login, so
      log in there first.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-feature-explorer</td><td><a href="/explorer">/explorer</a></td><td>{{ fractal_explorer_port }}</td>
      <td>Browse and plot measurement tables.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>filebrowser</td><td><a href="/files">/files</a></td><td>{{ fractal_filebrowser_port }}</td>
      <td>Browse, upload and download files in the Fractal data folder.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>This page</td><td><a href="{{ fractal_info_path }}/">{{ fractal_info_path }}/</a></td><td>&ndash;</td>
      <td>Served by nginx itself.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<h2>On the workspace only</h2>
<p>These services listen on the workspace but the firewall keeps them closed to
the outside. Reach them from a terminal on the workspace, or from your laptop
through an SSH tunnel.</p>
<p>The firewall is managed by SURF Research Cloud, not on the workspace: opening
a port to the internet is done in the SRC dashboard, and changing anything on the
workspace itself has no effect. Prefer the tunnel. PostgreSQL, SLURM and the
filebrowser port have no login of their own, so opening them would expose them
to anyone.</p>
<div class="table">
<table>
  <tr><th>Service</th><th>Port</th><th>What it is</th></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-server</td><td>{{ fractal_server_port }}</td>
      <td>The REST API behind fractal-web. Interactive API docs at <code>/docs</code>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>PostgreSQL</td><td>{{ fractal_postgres_port }}</td>
      <td>fractal-server's database.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SLURM</td><td>{{ fractal_slurm_ports | join(', ') }}</td>
      <td>The small SLURM cluster, inside a container, that runs Fractal jobs on this workspace.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<p>For example, to open the fractal-server API docs on your laptop at
<code>http://localhost:{{ fractal_server_port }}/docs</code>:</p>
<pre>ssh -L {{ fractal_server_port }}:localhost:{{ fractal_server_port }} &lt;username&gt;@{{ fractal_workspace_fqdn }}</pre>

<h2>Versions</h2>
<div class="table">
<table>
  <tr><th>Component</th><th>Version</th></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-server</td><td>{{ fractal_server_version }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-web</td><td>{{ fractal_web_version }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-client</td><td>{{ fractal_client_version }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>fractal-feature-explorer</td><td>{{ fractal_feature_explorer_version }}</td></tr>
</table>
</div>

<p class="muted">Documentation:
<a href="https://fractal-analytics-platform.github.io/">fractal-analytics-platform.github.io</a></p>

</body>
</html>
